1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,390
Good evening, Radio National listeners, and welcome to “Your Live Concert Hour” with Jill Boothby.

2
00:00:06,035 --> 00:00:15,610
Tonight we have something very special in store for you—a two-part program featuring two of Asia's premier folk music acts performing live for you in our studio.

3
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:20,670
In the first part of the program we'll be listening to the Young Asia Ensemble.

4
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:29,250
This is one of Asia's most innovative groups, with performers from four different Asian countries who blend a variety of folk styles.

5
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:36,550
In the second half, we'll hear the Japanese ensemble, Kaito, who specialize in natural acoustic sounds.

6
00:00:36,875 --> 00:00:42,230
And don't forget that both of these groups will be performing this weekend at the World Folk Festival.
